WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.500
G'day folks!

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.500
I'm Eddie Woo.

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:04.600
Maths teacher and host of Wootube.

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:08.220
I've served up 160 million minutes of online maths lessons.

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:12.640
And I've seen first hand the huge difference
the internet can make to a kid's education.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:15.960
Like this, because remember the length is
X, right?

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:17.960
You see it!

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:19.420
But only if they can access it.

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:23.020
Sadly, 1 in 6 young Australians live in poverty.

00:00:23.029 --> 00:00:26.320
And with modern education often reliant on
the internet,

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:28.550
many young people are being left behind.

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:29.929
That's why I'm here.

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:32.900
Because Optus is partnering with charities like The Smith Family

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:34.740
On the Donate Your Data initiative.

00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:38.980
Optus customers can now donate some of their data to those who need it most.

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:40.960
So how much of a difference can we make?

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:42.600
Well, quite a lot actually.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:47.720
If 1GB equals about 3.8 hours of online video.

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:54.560
And if just half of my 700,000 subscribers
donated 1GB each...

00:00:54.560 --> 00:01:01.280
That will be equal to 350,000 GB, which is
over a million hours of access to my maths lessons.

00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:03.920
And it doesn't just stop at maths.

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:09.340
Regular internet access can help kids in need
learn, create and connect with the world around them.

00:01:09.740 --> 00:01:10.740
It's super simple.

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.760
If you're on an eligible Optus mobile plan,

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:16.240
go to your My Optus app and donate your data today.

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:18.380
Together we can power their potential.

